WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:04.988
Today we will represent a place through organised sounds. Our work connects with

00:00:04.988 --> 00:00:07.197
selected artists and traditions in Ghana.

00:00:08.033 --> 00:00:13.086
List three sounds heard in the chosen setting. Name a design choice that a selected

00:00:13.086 --> 00:00:14.433
Ghanaian artist might make.

00:00:15.283 --> 00:00:18.462
Assign each sound to a gentle vocal or body action.

00:00:19.283 --> 00:00:23.251
Perform the sounds in order to represent morning, afternoon or evening.
